2 = Side View

Orbit-Cam:
W = Rotate up
S = Rotate down
A = Rotate left
D = Rotate right
Left Click = Rotate any direction

Free-cam:
W = Forward
S = Backwards
A = Left
D = Right
Q = Up
E = Down
Shift = Increase speed
Mouse Movement = Rotate camera
"
